Z||000011||the need for speed||09-29-2000||02:00 AM||||how the heck did you make that headliner very coool!!!!how is  it held in place? no more annoying sagging headliner ||||reg||1
Z||000012||MikeSchaefer||09-29-2000||05:15 AM||||Hi,  I was told the headliner was made by a company the went out of business and sold it's prototype.  But Fiero Bob told me he had seen one on another car once, so they might actually be a product for sale somewhere.  I would love to find this out also, as I want one in my future fieros.  Yeah, no more headliner problems at all!  It is held in place by the coat hanger, third brake light, and sun visor screws.<BR>Later,<BR>Michael Schaefer <A HREF="http://surf.to/fiero" TARGET=_blank>http://surf.to/fiero</A> ||||reg||6
